      "line_num": 62,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**Reproduce Reviewer T's bottom-of-page cutoff on 3.0.0 before fixing it. It was reported against 2.3.2. Three surfaces have since been rebuilt as server-rendered fragments by the no-build strangler migration, so the defect may not survive the deploy \u2014 and a fix written against the old Svelte surface would land in code that is being deleted.**\n`TODO.md:L62`",
