      "id": "2efd7edbcfc39fa7",
      "line_num": 64,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**Diagnose the unresponsive Space Agent via `/admin/diagnostics`. Not actionable until the deploy lands \u2014 that page shipped in 2.3.3 and the how-to-fix modals in 2.3.4, so today we would be debugging an old build blind while the tooling built for exactly this sits three tags up the shelf.**\n`TODO.md:L64`",
