      "line_num": 80,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**Provision Realtor R his own instance rather than leaving a paying customer on the shared demo box. Decided 2026-07-30. Solves three problems at once: recurring tenant cleanup, uncapped shared spend, and his working data sitting beside strangers'.**\n`TODO.md:L80`",
