    },
    {
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "2f45451f9b82601c",
      "line_num": 87,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**1. Spaces multi-user \u2014 three people (principal, assistant, VA) share one workspace from day one, and the customer's primary success metric is unreachable without it. Highest value, do first. Extends `### v2.x \u2014 Near Term` \u2192 _Spaces Enhancements_.**\n`TODO.md:L87`",
