      "line_num": 88,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**2. Spend budgets per user AND per API key \u2014 required before a customer instance goes live with hosted models and three sharers. See the backlog item; the try.sage uncapped-Groq note there is now a live commercial exposure, not a hypothetical.**\n`TODO.md:L88`",
