      "line_num": 89,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**3. Sprig catalog de-hardcoding (marketplace M1) \u2014 prerequisite for shipping the tooling as autoconfig Sprigs, and therefore for the segment story rather than just this customer. The blocker is the hardcoded Python `CATALOG` in `supervisor.py`.**\n`TODO.md:L89`",
